<h2 class="law-h2" id="quick">Quick answers</h2>
        <p class="law-sub">The questions Alabama boards ask most. The first two decide which of the rest apply to you.</p>
        <p class="law-note"><strong>Read these alongside your governing documents.</strong> Each answer notes the statute it comes from, so you and your attorney can go to the source.</p>
        <div class="law-table-wrap">
