              <tr><td class="q">Does it apply to our community?</td><td>It applies where the declaration was recorded with the judge of probate on or after January 1, 2016. Older communities are covered only if a majority of members elect to be.</td><td><span class="law-cite">35-20-3(a)</span></td></tr>
