              <tr><td class="q">Do we file anything with the state?</td><td>Yes. Covered associations file bylaws or other governing documents and the original covenants with the Secretary of State, which keeps a public searchable database.</td><td><span class="law-cite">35-20-5(b)</span></td></tr>
